(two-stage-ballistic-rocket)
*title Source-driven two-stage rocket ascent and ballistic return
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0

*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=0 long=0 lat=0 vel=50 gama=80 psi=90 time=0 mass=1000
  *file vehicle.dat time alt vel mass thrust
  *segment 1 stage-1-powered
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *prop thrust=100000 mdot=20
    *when time>20 goto 2
  *segment 2 stage-2-powered
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *prop thrust=50000 mdot=5
    *when time>45 goto 3
  *segment 3 ballistic-coast-and-return
    *integ dtprnt=1 dt=0.1
    *when alt<0 stop
    *when time>1000 stop
*end
